  "html": "<p>The Shadow Temple Layout is one of the most visually stunning and interesting in the whole game.  It first appears in <a href=\"/wiki/The_Shadow's_Embrace\" title=\"The Shadow's Embrace\">The Shadow's Embrace</a>.  There are sliding gates that open to reveal lots of monsters behind them, and plenty of battlements for monsters to hide behind.  The whole thing is dark and gloomy (these pictures have been brightened).\n</p>\n<table>\n<tr>\n<th>Shadow Temple Layout Appearance\n</th><th>Shadow Temple Layout Typical Map\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"thumb tnone\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:402px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Layout_Dark_castle.jpg\" title=\"Layout Dark castle.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"247\" src=\"/images/Layout_Dark_castle.jpg\" width=\"400\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Layout_Dark_castle.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div></div></div></div></div>\n</td><td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"thumb tnone\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:402px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Map_Dark_castle.jpg\" title=\"Map Dark castle.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"331\" src=\"/images/Map_Dark_castle.jpg\" width=\"400\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Map_Dark_castle.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div></div></div></div></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
